{"s6770d01e7d15fe":"面包屑","s203c08e0d44ac3":"首页","s8a5edab2826324":"/","s7855e5e9727ea5":"博客","se2d4efa59baa78":"技术博客","s9d6a9b53ef5f3b":"2025.07.22","s1487d577d5865a":"HAMi vGPU 方案：Core & Memory 隔离测试","s0e3d8855d6491c":"密","sc6e4b855eea2d7":"密瓜智能","sc36f8a800aae26":"发布团队","s2e312abf3b5bec":"复制原文链接","s9fe501ca737f6b":"HAMi 显存隔离测试","s537a018b54b536":"技术原理 · 工程实践 · 开源洞察","sec7580fa3d47ab":"DYNAMIA · OPEN SOURCE & AI INFRASTRUCTURE","sd455f7230dff59":"上一篇给大家分享了开源的 vGPU 方案 HAMi，本文主要对其提供的 GPU Core & Memory 隔离功能进行测试。","sff2fbf24e8af48":"本文目录 · 5 节","s3b2d0794ee6f67":"文章目录","s938db8c9f82c8c":"01","sdbc66c7cab739b":"测试结论","sa953f09a1b6b67":"02","sf238d553d576a4":"环境准备","s0b8efa5a3bf104":"03","sa250648fd28c1b":"算力隔离测试","s6cd5b6e51936a4":"04","sebefe3f8f4beb3":"显存隔离测试","sc97550ce8213ef":"05","s6bf8bdb1f6eefa":"小结","sf7de1ee6c6963e":"之前给大家分享了开源的 vGPU 方案 HAMI，本文主要对其提供的 GPU Core & Memory 隔离功能进行测试。","s2290eb7bb65a4d":"本文摘自：","sc4f87c892102d7":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qfdHqpendMC6_zS_isCluw","s2867a77277eda1":"省流","sea47a1976dee0d":"HAMI vGPU 方案提供的 Core & Memory 隔离基本符合预期：","s535df33e8cfd18":"Core 隔离","se513de21bd18a2":"：Pod 能使用的算力会围绕设定值波动，但是一段时间内平均下来和申请的 gpucores（即为 Pod 设置的 GPU 核心资源配额）基本一致","sb8b5983f8ed0f8":"Memory 隔离","se287d461a15879":"：Pod 中申请的 GPU 内存超过设定值时会直接提示 CUDA OOM","s4f3ea03f524359":"1. 环境准备","sa28a900cc47bb6":"简单设一下测试环境","s7eacd648ed0ebe":"GPU: A40 * 2","s2a52498fa68b2f":"K8s: v1.23.17","sf4bff25ee245ef":"HAMI: v2.3.13","s9378c1ca6a3cee":"GPU 环境","s942fed4b3be1ae":"使用 GPU-Operator 安装 GPU 驱动、Container Runtime 之类的","s1bb36052c99a8d":"然后安装 HAMI，参考 -> ","s0963a28a87071c":"上一篇文章《开源 vGPU 方案：HAMI，实现细粒度 GPU 切分》","sd1992adbd98078":"测试环境","s608dc6649d3d80":"直接使用 torch 镜像启动 Pod 作为测试环境就好","sa1aeb5b0ce7a2d":"docker pull pytorch/pytorch:2.4.1-cuda11.8-cudnn9-runtime\n","s910d30eaf51ecd":"测试脚本","s0d183c1b66024f":"可以使用 PyTorch 提供的 Examples 作为测试脚本","s5995ff8218ac60":"这边是一个训练的 Demo，会打印每一步的时间，算力给的越低，每一步耗时也就越长。","s0382eae83aa392":"具体用法也很简单：","sbad1b7319c328c":"先克隆项目","s0d4e971e3793a7":"git ","sb5d61dc89a35d2":"clone","sf2757003f274e4":" https://github.com/pytorch/examples.git\n","s1f244b63c9fc0d":"然后启动服务模拟消耗 GPU 的任务即可","s21e721c35a5823":"cd","s1416e5bdf39ece":" /mnt/imagenet/\npython main.py -a resnet18 --dummy\n","s148d195e21b05d":"配置","sc8bffe01fce93a":"需要在 Pod 中注入环境变量 ","se32055f1c6e12c":"GPU_CORE_UTILIZATION_POLICY=force","seb0d5884569b39":"。","sba50588afb84d5":"该环境变量用于控制 GPU Core 利用率的限制策略，常见取值有 ","s37a8eec1ce1968":"default","saa57eecf9a9697":"（默认，仅当有多个 Pod 使用同一 GPU 时才限制算力）和 ","s32500d7500ce07":"force","s693f6c33c99d38":"（无论是否有其他 Pod，都强制限制算力），默认值为 ","s74dbcc4879e297":"默认情况下，限制策略是：当该 GPU 只有一个 Pod 在使用时，就不会做算力限制。","s4dd542633dc9cc":"Note: 这也算是一种优化，可以提升 GPU 利用率，反正闲着也是闲着，如果要强制限制就必须增加环境变量","sd435dbb12733d4":"完整 Yaml","s29f00637d0177f":"以 hostPath 方式将 examples 项目挂载到 Pod 里进行测试，并将 command 配置为启动命令。","s71684eb9186324":"通过在 YAML 文件中配置 vGPU 的 resource requests/limits，将其限制为 30% 或者 60%，分别进行测试。","s26e50ac42350a6":"完整 yaml 如下：","s111d0e0c3c7afe":"apiVersion:","s3bfc269594ef64":"v1","s08863725c9d14a":"kind:","s0a6bb8b01de101":"Pod","s8c8c42289a1387":"metadata:","sd0d6d503f5acae":"name:","s6744411bacfdfd":"hami-30","sdecf94c04e0427":"namespace:","s36184fa5172f39":"spec:","s04968f51ee0482":"containers:","s3973e022e93220":"-","s70f519986eae4a":"simple-container","sa08a30338e824c":"image:","sbcf44b25e6f9af":"pytorch/pytorch:2.4.1-cuda11.8-cudnn9-runtime","s8ff7327fcdf50a":"command:","sc4ebc7684be8c9":" [","s2d0edc2f0650c5":"\"python\"","s0a07f659461970":", ","s01457db0777a79":"\"/mnt/imagenet/main.py\"","s1e2b64372d28f2":"\"-a\"","s0e012fcf6e87d5":"\"resnet18\"","sd5d062d6509b2b":"\"--dummy\"","sb5f395e26661ee":"]\n    ","scab2be2b3a2ed1":"resources:","s77f1ea54ba91af":"requests:","sc59593d408456a":"cpu:","s2bf175f9655e7b":"\"4\"","sb656fafe9c0938":"memory:","s7ee9f369d31947":"\"32Gi\"","seeaf4b13d57e7a":"nvidia.com/gpu:","s391552c099c101":"\"1\"","s2aa1b4a0dfba79":"nvidia.com/gpucores:","sf20e4586c63ba3":"\"30\"","s0b49f0a0adc075":"nvidia.com/gpumem:","s3cbacc98ea